# Training-run archives downloaded from Kaggle (checkpoints, caches, histories).
# Large binaries; the metrics they contain are transcribed into paper/new_results.md.
*.zip

# Paper evaluation outputs (paper/experiments/01_eval_and_ablation.ipynb).
# The CSVs, JSON, figures and helper scripts are committed; these two are not:
#   ckpts/  - 240 MB of .pth checkpoints, same policy as models/checkpoints/
#   *.npz   - regenerable per-backbone logit caches; the CSVs derived from them are the results
.nb1out/ckpts/
.nb1out/*.npz

# A2 replay outputs (regenerable from the harness)
data/eval/
